{
  "answer_markdown": "Mistral does offer a **free API tier**, also referred to as **Free mode**. This tier allows you to create API keys and use included monthly usage within the limits specified for your account. The limits for this tier can be viewed on the [Limits page](https://admin.mistral.ai/plateforme/limits) in the Mistral admin dashboard. [2]\n\nRate limits in Mistral vary by subscription tier and model. These limits are enforced independently for **requests per second** and **tokens per minute**, and exceeding them will result in a `429 Too Many Requests` error. You can monitor your usage by checking the `X-RateLimit-Remaining` response header in API responses. [1]\n\nIf you exceed the limits of the free tier, you can extend your usage through **Pay-as-you-go**, which allows you to go beyond the included monthly usage. However, this is not a separate plan for the API but an extension of your current subscription. [2]",
  "citations": [
    {
      "n": 2,
      "quote": "Free mode lets you create API keys and use included monthly usage within the limits shown on the Limits page."
    },
    {
      "n": 1,
