```bash
vibe --agent auto-approve
```

This command runs the Vibe CLI in non-interactive mode, automatically approving all edits without prompting the user [5].

If you want to start with an initial prompt, you can combine it with the `auto-approve` agent as follows:

```bash
vibe "Refactor the main function in cli/main.py to be more modular." --agent auto-approve
```

This will execute the task without requiring manual approval for each step [4].",
