    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "quote": "MCP tools are exposed under the pattern `{server_name}_{tool_name}`."
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "quote": "Configure permissions per tool just like built-in tools."
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "quote": "```toml\n[tools.fetch_server_get]\npermission = \"always\"\n```"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "quote": "You can also restrict which MCP tools are active using `enabled_tools` and `disabled_tools`."
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "quote": "```toml\n# Only enable serena's tools\nenabled_tools = [\"serena_*\"]\n\n# Disable all MCP tools and grep\ndisabled_tools = [\"mcp_*\", \"grep\"]\n```"
