{
  "answer_markdown": "You can block the Mistral crawler `MistralAI-Training` without losing links from Vibe's answers. The `MistralAI-User` crawler, which is used for user actions in Vibe and includes links to sources in its responses, should not be blocked as it is for user requests only and not for automated crawling. Blocking `MistralAI-Training` will only affect its automated crawling for generative AI training, which is unrelated to Vibe's answers.\n\nHere is the relevant information from the source:\n\n- `MistralAI-User` is for user actions in Vibe and is not used for crawling the web in any automatic fashion, nor to crawl content for generative AI training. [1]\n- `MistralAI-Training` crawls web content to help build datasets for training Mistral generative AI models and can be disallowed in your `robots.txt` file. [1]",
  "citations": [
