      "n": 1,
      "quote": "MistralAI-User` is for **user actions in Vibe**. When users ask Vibe a question, it may **visit a web page** to help answer and **include a link to the source in its response**. It is **not used for crawling the web in any automatic fashion, nor to crawl content for generative AI training**."
    },
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "This crawler is not used for search indexing or to answer live user queries in Vibe."
    }
  ],
